  "description": "DotRobotFramework is a framework that simplifies software development for robots.\nIt enables different parts of the robot (sensors, motions, behaviors, and interaction) to communicate with each other in a modular and real-time way.\nFor each part of the robot, an independent node is developed that communicates with other nodes via pub/sub or commands.\nThere is also the possibility to monitor all nodes through a heartbeat mechanism.",
